<section class="brand-story" id="story" aria-labelledby="brand-story-title"><div class="brand-story-collage"><figure class="brand-story-photo brand-story-photo--1"><img src="{{ 'brand-story-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Pattern drafting with scissors, measuring tape and striped fabric" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><figure class="brand-story-photo brand-story-photo--2"><img src="{{ 'brand-story-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Selecting fabric swatches for clothing" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><figure class="brand-story-photo brand-story-photo--3"><img src="{{ 'brand-story-3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Essaint branded bag with white linen trousers" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure><figure class="brand-story-photo brand-story-photo--4"><img src="{{ 'brand-story-4.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="White tee and navy pinstriped trousers styled in an armchair" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy"></figure></div><div class="brand-story-copy"><p class="brand-story-label">Brand story</p><h2 id="brand-story-title">From Lebanon.<br>To the world.</h2><div class="brand-story-text"><p>Lebanese people have always been known for their distinctive sense of style. Essaint was created during the war from a belief in our country, its people and its potential.</p><p>We believe every Lebanese person deserves refined, well-made clothing at an accessible price. Proudly crafted in Lebanon, Essaint represents resilience, ambition and hope for what comes next.</p></div><a class="brand-story-link" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Explore the collection <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a></div></section><div class="service-strip"><span>CRAFTED IN LEBANON</span><span>SHIPPING ON US OVER $100</span><span>7-DAY EASY EXCHANGES</span></div>
